/E (During the course of this project, we gained valuable hands-on experience in developing an AI-based web application under the guidance and resources provided by Intel. Firstly we were introduced to the WSL \(Windows Subsystem for Linux\) environment and Python Virtual Environments which served as the primary platforms for our development and deployment activities. Secondly we came to know about various AI tools and mechanisms and the current AI market for them, like LLMs, VLMs, RAG, LangChain, Prompt Engineering, Prompt Writing, using AI tools like Chat Bots, Machine Learning, Language Modelling, various Python tools used in AI, etc. We also came to know about the current market for Language based tasks like NLP and the current market shift from traditional NLP Processes to Modern Deep Learning based NLP Processes and Models like LLMs, Transformers, Encoders, etc. Then we came to know about two most important cloud based platforms, GitHub and Hugging Face for deployment and AI modelling. We were introduced to various state-of-the-art AI models used in Vision and Language or in combination, like the Llama Model, GPT Model, BERT Model, Paddle OCR, Easy OCR, etc. We were also provided with quality resources and study materials on these topics and various other AI based materials from Intel during this internship period. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [0 1]
>>
endobj
