/S /H2
/P 227 0 R
/T (Convolutional Networks \(GCN\) [33] or Bayesian Networks [28] has shown success in predicting form fields but requires massive historical datasets and often excludes unstructured textual fields. Furthermore, while AI-powered solutions like DocuMind [23] and Skyvern [25] offer high efficiency, their reliance on expensive, cloud-based APIs like GPT-4, Amazon Bedrock or AWS Textract [22] hinders offline use, while raising critical data privacy and latency concerns for sensitive public-sector data [16], [21], [24].)
/E (Convolutional Networks \(GCN\) [33] or Bayesian Networks [28] has shown success in predicting form fields but requires massive historical datasets and often excludes unstructured textual fields. Furthermore, while AI-powered solutions like DocuMind [23] and Skyvern [25] offer high efficiency, their reliance on expensive, cloud-based APIs like GPT-4, Amazon Bedrock or AWS Textract [22] hinders offline use, while raising critical data privacy and latency concerns for sensitive public-sector data [16], [21], [24].)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
