/T (In summary, while prior works have significantly solved numerous challenges of automating form-filling systems in India with great precision, IVAN AI and GovAI-Sub are the first to address significantly persistent challenges and synthesize these into a robust noise-resilient, multilingual, multimodal, light-weight, modular and accessibility-first pipeline specifically optimized for the Indian socio-technical context and script limitations with practical benchmarks.)
/E (In summary, while prior works have significantly solved numerous challenges of automating form-filling systems in India with great precision, IVAN AI and GovAI-Sub are the first to address significantly persistent challenges and synthesize these into a robust noise-resilient, multilingual, multimodal, light-weight, modular and accessibility-first pipeline specifically optimized for the Indian socio-technical context and script limitations with practical benchmarks.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
