469 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 230 0 R
/E (The GovAI-Sub web-app was implemented locally in the VS Code environment, while the IVAN AI system was developed using a distributed cloud-based platform to accommodate the diverse deep learning frameworks and GPU \(VRAM\) requirements of the IVAN AI components, due to the lack of suitable hardware configuration on local machines. Thus, the pipeline was executed across Google Colab and Kaggle Kernels to utilize their GPU enable development environments. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
endobj
470 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1690 0 R
/E (VS Code Environment Setup: The VS Code environment was setup with the WSL \(Windows Sub-System for Linux\) environment using the Ubuntu distribution on local machine, to facilitate better file and package \(using the UV package manager\) management, increase adaptability and create a clean, efficient development environment. The GovAI-Sub web-app was implemented in this setup using the Django framework inside a Python Virtual Environment to mitigate version conflicts.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
471 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1691 0 R
/E (Google Colab Environment setup: Running Python 3 kernel, the utilized hardware configurations comprised of 12.7 GB System RAM, 107.7 GB Disk Space and a single NVIDIA T4 GPU with 15 GB VRAM. The Surya OCR, Whisper Large-v3, BERT-Large-NER, PolyGlot framework and the nllb-200-distilled-600M were implemented on this environment along with their validation on the test datasets. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [4 5]
>>
endobj
472 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1692 0 R
/E (Kaggle Environment setup: Running Python 3 kernel too, utilized 30 GB System RAM, 57.6 GB Disk Space and dual NVIDIA T4 GPUs each of 15 GB VRAM. The PaddleOCR running on the PaddlePaddle Deep Learning framework was implemented in this environment, by stripping the environment off PyTorch, that is not supported by PaddleOCR components. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6 7]
>>
endobj
473 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 230 0 R
/E (Aside the local VS Code environment, the minimal setups for the cloud platforms were available through the standard configurations of Colab and Kaggle, and were sufficient for complete IVAN AI implementation and evaluation, demonstrating the system's lightweight and resource-efficient design. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
