/T (The NER Module \(IVAN-NER\): For form-entity extraction from OCR text, a domain-adapted BERT-Large model [40] was implemented, pre-trained on the CoNLL-2003 dataset [41]. The model was further fine-tuned on a domain-specific dataset \(IVAN-NER Dataset\) in an 80:20 split to produce the BERT-Doc-NER model, generalizing across 21 government specific entities and 9 government document types. The architecture utilized a 24-Layer Encoder-based Deep Neutral Network, a Linear)
/E (The NER Module \(IVAN-NER\): For form-entity extraction from OCR text, a domain-adapted BERT-Large model [40] was implemented, pre-trained on the CoNLL-2003 dataset [41]. The model was further fine-tuned on a domain-specific dataset \(IVAN-NER Dataset\) in an 80:20 split to produce the BERT-Doc-NER model, generalizing across 21 government specific entities and 9 government document types. The architecture utilized a 24-Layer Encoder-based Deep Neutral Network, a Linear)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [8]
>>
