523 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1700 0 R
/E (The OCR Module Enhancements \(IVAN-OCR\): To address the limitations of monolithic OCR engines, specifically poor text detection results of Surya-OCR [35] from Phase-I, the PaddleOCR [36] known for its robust text detection capabilities from complex images was implemented. But for the high computational cost of end-to-end PaddleOCR models on complex Indian documents, cross-engine hybrid OCR architectures were developed using the lightweight, dedicated modules of PaddleOCR with the Recognition module of Surya OCR in order to optimize the OCR system on complex degraded government documents, while being lightweight. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [2 3]
>>
endobj
