/E (The NER Module Enhancements \(IVAN-NER\): From the training and performances of Phase-I, the BERT-Doc-NER trained on 80:20 split was additionally fine-tuned again on the full IVAN-NER Dataset of 100 samples to enhance pattern generalization and observe NER model improvements to data augmentation, producing the BERT-Doc-NER-Max model. The model in Phase-II was fine-tuned with the same model configurations and training parameters as in Phase-I, but for 5 epochs.)
