/T (Stage 3 \(Language & Modality Page\): Users are prompted to choose their preferred form language \(currently supports English, Hindi, Bengali, Marathi, Tamil, Telugu\) and mode of operation among Document or Voice input \(Handwritten mode of input is not supported yet\). Then they are asked to provide the necessary information as Document or Voice and the provided data is processed by the OCR-Translator-NER pipeline or the ASR-Translator pipeline accordingly and stored in a Temporary Virtual Buffer. The processed information is then auto-filled to the corresponding form fields in the user's chosen language.)
/E (Stage 3 \(Language & Modality Page\): Users are prompted to choose their preferred form language \(currently supports English, Hindi, Bengali, Marathi, Tamil, Telugu\) and mode of operation among Document or Voice input \(Handwritten mode of input is not supported yet\). Then they are asked to provide the necessary information as Document or Voice and the provided data is processed by the OCR-Translator-NER pipeline or the ASR-Translator pipeline accordingly and stored in a Temporary Virtual Buffer. The processed information is then auto-filled to the corresponding form fields in the user's chosen language.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [17 18]
>>
