797 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 1743 0 R
/T (While the underlying models of the Paddle-Surya hybrid, nllb-200-distilled-600M and Whisper support 21, 22 and 12 Indic languages respectively, the empirical validation for IVAN AI was conducted on six representative languages, English, Bengali, Hindi, Marathi, Tamil and Telugu. This subset was selected to represent diverse script families \(Indo-Aryan and Dravidian\) while maintaining a manageable scope for rigorous ground-truth verification.)
/E (While the underlying models of the Paddle-Surya hybrid, nllb-200-distilled-600M and Whisper support 21, 22 and 12 Indic languages respectively, the empirical validation for IVAN AI was conducted on six representative languages, English, Bengali, Hindi, Marathi, Tamil and Telugu. This subset was selected to represent diverse script families \(Indo-Aryan and Dravidian\) while maintaining a manageable scope for rigorous ground-truth verification.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
798 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 1744 0 R
/T (The system validation was deliberately restricted to 9 document types and 3 synthetic forms to prevent inadvertent creation of unauthorized digital mirrors of official government portals and to keep the evaluation process on a manageable-scale. By validating on synthetic forms that replicate the structural complexity of actual government forms including technical terminology, nested fields and multi-column layouts, the system's technical capability is demonstrated accurately while maintaining compliance with legal and ethical development standards.)
/E (The system validation was deliberately restricted to 9 document types and 3 synthetic forms to prevent inadvertent creation of unauthorized digital mirrors of official government portals and to keep the evaluation process on a manageable-scale. By validating on synthetic forms that replicate the structural complexity of actual government forms including technical terminology, nested fields and multi-column layouts, the system's technical capability is demonstrated accurately while maintaining compliance with legal and ethical development standards.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
