878 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 243 0 R
/T (Rate \(WER\) and Character Error Rate \(CER\) assume a linear, accurate reading order, however Indian government documents such as Aadhaar, PAN, Birth Certificates, etc., often lack a predefined semantic sequence. Because these documents are utilized for discrete data extraction rather than continuous reading, the system adopts the principles of Information Retrieval \(IR\). This approach prioritizes degree of retention of key details from document scans over spatial arrangement, ensuring critical information is preserved for NER extraction regardless of document layout or noise.)
/E (Rate \(WER\) and Character Error Rate \(CER\) assume a linear, accurate reading order, however Indian government documents such as Aadhaar, PAN, Birth Certificates, etc., often lack a predefined semantic sequence. Because these documents are utilized for discrete data extraction rather than continuous reading, the system adopts the principles of Information Retrieval \(IR\). This approach prioritizes degree of retention of key details from document scans over spatial arrangement, ensuring critical information is preserved for NER extraction regardless of document layout or noise.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
