/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 1802 0 R
/T (Metric for IVAN-ASR: The standard metric used is to re-evaluate IVAN-ASR from Phase-I is BERTScore, that evaluates semantic similarity between transcribed speech and ground-truth text through precision, recall and F1-score using contextual embeddings. This prioritizes semantic equivalence, even without exact lexical matches essential for voice-based form-filling where users might articulate information with varied linguistic structures.)
/E (Metric for IVAN-ASR: The standard metric used is to re-evaluate IVAN-ASR from Phase-I is BERTScore, that evaluates semantic similarity between transcribed speech and ground-truth text through precision, recall and F1-score using contextual embeddings. This prioritizes semantic equivalence, even without exact lexical matches essential for voice-based form-filling where users might articulate information with varied linguistic structures.)
