/T (Hybrid DR OCR outperforms Hybrid LR OCR in Phase-II in terms of F1 Score, Normalized Similarity and processing time. Also, Hybrid DR OCR \(60.007%\) in Phase-II outperforms Surya LR OCR \(59.02%\) from Phase-I, thus Hybrid DR OCR Algorithm qualifies in the model selection process for the IVAN-OCR component for designing the OCR-Translator-NER Pipeline.)
/E (Hybrid DR OCR outperforms Hybrid LR OCR in Phase-II in terms of F1 Score, Normalized Similarity and processing time. Also, Hybrid DR OCR \(60.007%\) in Phase-II outperforms Surya LR OCR \(59.02%\) from Phase-I, thus Hybrid DR OCR Algorithm qualifies in the model selection process for the IVAN-OCR component for designing the OCR-Translator-NER Pipeline.)
