1538 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 242 0 R
/T (Phase-II focuses on evaluating the enhancements made in IVAN-OCR and IVAN-NER components, evaluating IVAN AI components on different metrics as from Phase-I with respect to their unique strategy of performance in IVAN AI framework, followed by model selection as per the modified component performances from both the Phases. Based on the most suitable alternatives from model selection process, the end-to-end OCR-Translator-NER and ASR-Translator Pipelines are framed and evaluated.)
/E (Phase-II focuses on evaluating the enhancements made in IVAN-OCR and IVAN-NER components, evaluating IVAN AI components on different metrics as from Phase-I with respect to their unique strategy of performance in IVAN AI framework, followed by model selection as per the modified component performances from both the Phases. Based on the most suitable alternatives from model selection process, the end-to-end OCR-Translator-NER and ASR-Translator Pipelines are framed and evaluated.)
/Pg 31 0 R
>>
