/T (Despite these challenges, the IVAN-AI and GovAI-Sub system provides a robust, end-to-end, modular and likely adaptable pipeline integrated successfully for automating Indic form-filing tasks with considerable benchmarks and novelties for being developed on such a complex, resource-constrained NLP domain. It counters significant research gaps, with high enhancement potential in future with lesser efforts.)
/E (Despite these challenges, the IVAN-AI and GovAI-Sub system provides a robust, end-to-end, modular and likely adaptable pipeline integrated successfully for automating Indic form-filing tasks with considerable benchmarks and novelties for being developed on such a complex, resource-constrained NLP domain. It counters significant research gaps, with high enhancement potential in future with lesser efforts.)
/Pg 39 0 R
>>
