/E (The IVAN-Translator with a negligible latency of 0.297s while being immune to hallucinations, code-mixing and noise from OCR or ASR makes it a highly important component serving as a novel, lightweight, zero-shot framework for dataset limitations enabling the Domain-Shift strategy, also serving significantly in handling multilingual code-mixed scripts throughout the IVAN AI Pipeline.)
